{"id":"msg_m_ex_alice_06","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_alice","label":"Alice · Nikke"},"label":"6. Rabbity,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_alice_05","next":"msg_m_ex_alice_wonderlandbunny_01","speakers":{"alice":"Alice"},"icons":{"alice":"si_c191_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_1","text":"Rabbity,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_2","text":"does your butt light up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_3","text":"Come again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_4","text":"I'm just curious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_5","text":"Does your butt light up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_6","text":"I would say... no?","jump":"m_ex_alice_06_8"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_7","text":"I can't see, so I'm not sure.","jump":"m_ex_alice_06_10"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_8","text":"Yeah, probably not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_9","text":"Most people's butts don't light up.","jump":"m_ex_alice_06_15"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_10","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_11","text":"Then...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_12","text":"I can't see my butt either.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_13","text":"Could it be lighting up too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_14","text":"There's no way.","jump":"m_ex_alice_06_15"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_15","text":"But I've heard of this creature up on the surface","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_16","text":"whose butt lights up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_17","text":"It's a living organism, about as big as a fingernail.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_18","text":"Once night falls,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_19","text":"you can see a greenish-yellow light shining from its rear end.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_20","text":"Do you think such a creature truly exists?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_21","text":"You're talking about a firefly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_22","text":"Oh, is that what they're called?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_23","text":"So you know what I'm talking about!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_24","text":"They emanate that light as part of their mating ritual.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_25","text":"Wow,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_26","text":"now that's something I'd love to see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_27","text":"It'd be even better if you and Queen were there too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_28","text":"When we have time, we can all go looking for some fireflies together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_29","text":"All right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_30","text":"But Rabbity,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_31","text":"what's 'mating', exactly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_32","text":"... Would you look at that? A new mission just came up. Gotta go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_33","text":"Oh, okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_34","text":"You can explain it to me next time, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_06_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_06_35","text":"... I'll try.","jump":null}],"chat":true}